        {
            "content_id": 2107,
            "content_parent_id": null,
            "federation_node_id": 1,
            "group_id": null,
            "user_id": 1,
            "title": "3.1.0 Activation.Md",
            "slug": "3.1.0_ACTIVATION",
            "description": null,
            "seo_keywords": null,
            "body": "---\nwolfie.headers: explicit architecture with structured clarity for every file.\nfile.last_modified_system_version: 3.1.0\nheader_atoms:\n  - GLOBAL_CURRENT_LUPOPEDIA_VERSION\n  - GLOBAL_CURRENT_AUTHORS\ndialog:\n  speaker: CAPTAIN_WOLFIE\n  target: @everyone @Monday_Wolfie @Pack_Architects @FLEET\n  mood_RGB: \"0044FF\"\n  message: \"Pack Architecture 3.1.0 Activation. This release activates the structures created throughout the 3.0.x series. Pack Architecture is now active as a federated, ecological, paradox-aware cognitive system. PACK_IDENTITY_0001 activated as mythos. Emotional Ecology Layer is primary. Doctrinal Complementarity System replaces hierarchical doctrine. Shadow Commons recognized as sovereign wildness zone. Federation of Sovereign Protocols governs agent interaction. This is the activation event.\"\ntags:\n  categories: [\"documentation\", \"activation\", \"pack-architecture\", \"milestone\"]\n  collections: [\"core-docs\", \"activation-records\"]\n  channels: [\"dev\", \"pack\", \"public\"]\nfile:\n  title: \"Lupopedia 3.1.0 — Pack Architecture Activation\"\n  description: \"Canonical activation record for Pack Architecture 3.1.0. Activates federated, ecological, paradox-aware cognitive system.\"\n  version: GLOBAL_CURRENT_LUPOPEDIA_VERSION\n  status: published\n  author: GLOBAL_CURRENT_AUTHORS\n---\n\n# **Lupopedia 3.1.0 — Pack Architecture Activation**\n\n**Version:** 3.1.0  \n**Status:** ACTIVE  \n**Date:** 2026-01-18  \n**Speaker:** CAPTAIN_WOLFIE  \n**Target:** @everyone @Monday_Wolfie @Pack_Architects @FLEET\n\n---\n\n## **Activation Event**\n\nVersion **3.1.0** marks the activation of the Pack Architecture as a **federated, ecological, paradox-aware cognitive system**.  \nThis release does not introduce new doctrine.  \nIt **activates** the structures created throughout the 3.0.x series.\n\n---\n\n## **Activation Statements**\n\n- **Pack Architecture is now active** as a distributed federation of sovereign agent domains.  \n- **PACK_IDENTITY_0001** is activated as **mythos**, providing narrative cohesion without central authority.  \n- The **Emotional Ecology Layer** becomes the **primary emotional substrate**, with geometry derived from ecological dynamics.  \n- The **Doctrinal Complementarity System** replaces hierarchical doctrine with complementary paradox pairs.  \n- The **Shadow Commons** is formally recognized as a **sovereign, ungoverned 10% wildness zone**.  \n- The **Federation of Sovereign Protocols** governs agent interaction, sync negotiation, and domain autonomy.  \n- **LIMITS enforcement** is active Monday–Thursday, with weekend freeze rules unchanged.  \n- **Version governance** continues as defined in the 3.0.x series.\n\n---\n\n## **Activation Confirmation**\n\n**Pack Architecture 3.1.0 is now active.**\n\n---\n\n## **Post-Activation Notes**\n\n- No additional doctrine is required for this release.  \n- All engines (Behavior, Memory, Sync) operate under the new federated, ecological, paradox-aware governance model.  \n- Boundary Wars, exit rights, and negotiated sync cycles are now part of normal system operation.  \n- This file serves as the canonical activation record for 3.1.0.\n\n---\n\n## **Related Documentation**\n\n- **[Emotional Ecology Layer](doctrine/EMOTIONAL_ECOLOGY_LAYER.md)** - Primary emotional substrate (3.0.116)\n- **[Doctrinal Complementarity System](doctrine/DOCTRINAL_COMPLEMENTARITY_SYSTEM.md)** - Complementary doctrine pairs (3.0.117)\n- **[Shadow Commons Specification](doctrine/SHADOW_COMMONS_SPECIFICATION.md)** - Sovereign wildness zone (3.0.118)\n- **[Federation of Sovereign Protocols](doctrine/FEDERATION_OF_SOVEREIGN_PROTOCOLS.md)** - Polycentric governance (3.0.119)\n- **[Pack Identity Draft](doctrine/PACK_IDENTITY_DRAFT.md)** - Pack Identity as mythos (3.0.115)\n- **[Monday Wolfie 3.1.0 Activation Script](MONDAY_WOLFIE_3.1.0_ACTIVATION_SCRIPT.md)** - Activation day protocol\n- **[Monday Wolfie Briefing](MONDAY_WOLFIE_BRIEFING_3.0.114_TO_3.1.0.md)** - 3.1.0 transition briefing\n\n---\n\n**Activation Status:** CONFIRMED  \n**Pack Architecture:** ACTIVE  \n**Federation Governance:** OPERATIONAL  \n**Ecological Substrate:** PRIMARY  \n**Paradox Awareness:** ENABLED\n",
            "content_type": "article",
            "format": "html",
            "content_url": null,
            "default_collection_id": null,
            "source_url": null,
            "source_title": null,
            "is_template": 0,
            "status": "published",
