            "title": "Monday Resume Context.Md",
            "slug": "MONDAY_RESUME_CONTEXT",
            "description": null,
            "seo_keywords": null,
            "body": "---\nwolfie.headers: explicit architecture with structured clarity for every file.\nfile.last_modified_system_version: 3.0.50\nheader_atoms:\n  - GLOBAL_CURRENT_LUPOPEDIA_VERSION\n  - GLOBAL_CURRENT_AUTHORS\ndialog:\n  speaker: SYSTEM\n  target: @Captain_Wolfie\n  mood_RGB: \"0066FF\"\n  message: \"Context resume header for Monday work sessions after weekend hibernation.\"\ntags:\n  categories: [\"documentation\", \"workflow\"]\n  collections: [\"core-docs\"]\n  channels: [\"dev\"]\nfile:\n  title: \"Monday Resume Context Header\"\n  description: \"Quick context restoration for resuming Lupopedia work on Monday\"\n  version: GLOBAL_CURRENT_LUPOPEDIA_VERSION\n  status: published\n  author: GLOBAL_CURRENT_AUTHORS\n---\n\n# Monday Resume Context Header\n\n**Session Date:** [INSERT DATE]  \n**Current Version:** 3.0.50  \n**Target Version:** 3.1.0  \n**Operational Mode:** Normal (post-hibernation)\n\n---\n\n## System State at Resume\n\n**Database:**\n- Tables: 120 (verified)\n- Schema: No drift detected\n- Migrations: All executed through 3.0.46\n\n**Documentation:**\n- Version: 3.0.50 (all files synchronized)\n- Dialog files: All updated to 3.0.50\n- CHANGELOG.md: Current through 3.0.50\n\n**Fleet Status:**\n- Cognitive Load Limit: 9 agents\n- Fleet Silence Protocol: Active\n- One-Voice Protocol: Enabled\n- Dry-Dock Mode: Disabled (normal operations resumed)\n\n**Last Session:**\n- Date: 2026-01-16\n- Final Version: 3.0.50\n- Status: Hibernation mode activated\n- Work: Version correction, dialog updates, cognitive load configuration\n\n---\n\n## What Happened Friday (2026-01-16)\n\n**Major Work:**\n1. Version correction from 3.1.0 to 3.0.50\n2. Dialog files updated to 3.0.50\n3. Cognitive load limit set to 9 agents\n4. Fleet count corrected (7 agents total, 3 active)\n5. Dry-Dock Mode activated\n6. Session closed in hibernation mode\n\n**Files Changed:**\n- config/global_atoms.yaml (version 3.0.50)\n- 8 dialog files (version headers updated)\n- CHANGELOG.md (3.0.50 entry added)\n- Multiple doctrine files (version corrections)\n\n**No Code Changes:**\n- Version 3.0.50 was purely administrative\n- No database changes\n- No feature additions\n- No bug fixes\n\n---\n\n## Monday Priorities\n\n**Priority 1: Tool Verification**\n- Verify Cursor online\n- Verify VS Code online\n- Verify database connection\n- Verify schema count (120 tables)\n\n**Priority 2: Load Ascent Manifest**\n- Open `TO_DO_FOR_VERSION_4_1_0.md`\n- Review History Reconciliation requirements\n- Identify first task\n\n**Priority 3: Begin History Reconciliation**\n- Document 2014-2025 gap\n- Fill in missing system history\n- Update documentation with reconciliation notes\n\n**Priority 4: Continue v3.1.0 Ascent**\n- Follow Ascent Manifest task sequence\n- Maintain One-Voice Protocol\n- Log all work to dialog files\n\n---\n\n## Context Restoration Checklist\n\n**Before starting work:**\n- [ ] Read this header completely\n- [ ] Verify all tools online\n- [ ] Check schema count (120 tables)\n- [ ] Load Ascent Manifest\n- [ ] Review Friday's session summary\n- [ ] Confirm current version (3.0.50)\n- [ ] Disable Dry-Dock Mode\n- [ ] Begin first task\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n**Current Version:** 3.0.50  \n**Next Version:** 3.1.0 (public release prep)  \n**Tables:** 120  \n**Agents:** 7 total (3 active Friday)  \n**Cognitive Load Limit:** 9  \n**Fleet Protocol:** One-Voice Protocol  \n**Operational Mode:** Normal (post-hibernation)\n\n---\n\n## Files to Review\n\n1. `TO_DO_FOR_VERSION_4_1_0.md` - Ascent Manifest\n2. `dialogs/session_2026_01_16_version_4_0_46.md` - Friday session log\n3. `CHANGELOG.md` - Version 3.0.50 entry\n4. `docs/MONDAY_START_OF_DAY.md` - 8-step checklist\n\n---\n\n*Created: 2026-01-16*  \n*Version: 3.0.50*  \n*Purpose: Quick context restoration for Monday work sessions*\n",
