            "title": "01 History Reconciliation",
            "slug": "ascent/01_history_reconciliation",
            "description": null,
            "seo_keywords": null,
            "body": "---\nwolfie.headers: explicit architecture with structured clarity for every file.\nfile.last_modified_system_version: 3.0.50\nheader_atoms:\n  - GLOBAL_CURRENT_LUPOPEDIA_VERSION\n  - GLOBAL_CURRENT_AUTHORS\ntags:\n  categories: [\"documentation\", \"planning\"]\n  collections: [\"core-docs\"]\n  channels: [\"dev\"]\nfile:\n  title: \"Big Rock 1: History Reconciliation\"\n  description: \"Document complete system history from 1996-2026 including 11-year absence\"\n  version: GLOBAL_CURRENT_LUPOPEDIA_VERSION\n  status: not-started\n  author: GLOBAL_CURRENT_AUTHORS\n---\n\n# Big Rock 1: History Reconciliation\n\n**Status:** Not Started  \n**Priority:** High  \n**Estimated Duration:** 1 week  \n**Target Completion:** Week 1\n\n---\n\n## Objective\n\nDocument the complete history of Eric's creative work and system development from 1996-2026, including:\n- Active creative period (1996-2013)\n- Transition and absence (2014-2025)\n- Resurgence and Lupopedia development (2025-2026)\n\n---\n\n## Why This Matters\n\n### Context for Public Release\n- Explains system origins and evolution\n- Provides credibility through 18 years of experience\n- Documents the 11-year absence honestly\n- Shows the massive 2025-2026 resurgence\n\n### Foundation for Documentation\n- History informs architecture decisions\n- Timeline explains design patterns\n- Experience validates technical choices\n- Absence explains fresh perspective\n\n---\n\n## Scope\n\n### Timeline Coverage\n- **1996-2013:** 18 years of active creative work\n- **2014:** Transition year (personal tragedy, absence begins)\n- **2015-2025:** 11-year absence period\n- **2025-2026:** Return and Lupopedia development\n\n### Documentation Areas\n1. Year-by-year history files\n2. Timeline visualization\n3. History index\n4. Period summaries\n5. Impact analysis\n\n---\n\n## Deliverables\n\n### Required Files\n\n**History Index:**\n- `docs/history/HISTORY_INDEX.md` ? (to be created)\n\n**Timeline:**\n- `docs/history/TIMELINE_1996_2026.md` ? (to be created)\n\n**Active Period (1996-2013):**\n- `docs/history/1996-2013/README.md` ? (created)\n- `docs/history/1996-2013/1996.md` ? (created)\n- `docs/history/1996-2013/1997-2001.md` ? (created)\n- `docs/history/1996-2013/2002.md` ? (created)\n- `docs/history/1996-2013/2003-2013.md` ? (created)\n\n**Absence Period (2014-2025):**\n- `docs/history/2014-2025/README.md` (to be created)\n- `docs/history/2014-2025/2014.md` ? (created)\n- `docs/history/2014-2025/2015-2025.md` (to be created)\n\n**Resurgence (2025-2026):**\n- `docs/history/2025-2026/README.md` (to be created)\n- `docs/history/2025-2026/2025.md` (to be created)\n- `docs/history/2025-2026/2026.md` (to be created)\n\n---\n\n## Tasks\n\n### Phase 1: Structure (Day 1)\n- [x] Create folder structure\n- [x] Create placeholder files for 1996-2013\n- [x] Create 2014 transition file\n- [ ] Create history index\n- [ ] Create timeline file\n\n### Phase 2: Content (Days 2-4)\n- [ ] Fill in 1996-2013 details (Eric's input)\n- [ ] Document 2014 transition (sensitive handling)\n- [ ] Document 2015-2025 absence period\n- [ ] Document 2025 return (August)\n- [ ] Document 2026 development (January)\n\n### Phase 3: Polish (Day 5)\n- [ ] Review all history files\n- [ ] Verify timeline accuracy\n- [ ] Cross-reference with CHANGELOG.md\n- [ ] Add missing links\n- [ ] Final formatting pass\n\n---\n\n## Success Criteria\n\nHistory Reconciliation is complete when:\n- [ ] All year files created and filled\n- [ ] Timeline covers 1996-2026\n- [ ] History index complete\n- [ ] 2014 transition documented sensitively\n- [ ] 2025-2026 resurgence documented\n- [ ] All cross-references working\n- [ ] Eric approves content\n\n---\n\n## Notes\n\n### Sensitive Content\n- 2014 requires sensitive handling (wife's death)\n- Focus on creative work impact, not personal details\n- Respect privacy while being honest\n\n### Eric's Input Required\n- 1996-2013 creative work details\n- Specific projects and achievements\n- Crafty Syntax development milestones\n- Design decisions and philosophy\n\n### Connection to Current System\n- Show how 1996-2013 work informs Lupopedia\n- Explain 11-year gap honestly\n- Highlight 2025-2026 accomplishments\n- Connect past experience to current architecture\n\n---\n\n## Related Documentation\n\n- **History Files:** `docs/history/`\n- **CHANGELOG.md:** System version history\n- **Global Atoms:** `config/global_atoms.yaml` (GLOBAL_ERIC_WOLFIE_TLDNR_2026)\n- **Version 3.0.60 Plan:** `docs/VERSION_4_0_60_PLAN.md`\n\n---\n\n*Created: 2026-01-16*  \n*Version: 3.0.50*  \n*Status: Not started - awaiting Monday execution*\n",
