            "body": "---\nwolfie.headers: explicit architecture with structured clarity for every file.\nfile.last_modified_system_version: 3.0.50\nheader_atoms:\n  - GLOBAL_CURRENT_LUPOPEDIA_VERSION\n  - GLOBAL_CURRENT_AUTHORS\ntags:\n  categories: [\"documentation\", \"tracking\"]\n  collections: [\"core-docs\"]\n  channels: [\"dev\"]\nfile:\n  title: \"Version 3.1.0 Progress Tracker\"\n  description: \"Daily progress tracking for 3.1.0 ascent tasks\"\n  version: GLOBAL_CURRENT_LUPOPEDIA_VERSION\n  status: active\n  author: GLOBAL_CURRENT_AUTHORS\n---\n\n# Version 3.1.0 Progress Tracker\n\n**Current Version:** 3.0.50  \n**Target Version:** 3.1.0  \n**Last Updated:** 2026-01-16\n\n---\n\n## Overall Progress\n\n**Status:** Planning Phase  \n**Completion:** 0% (0/4 Big Rocks complete)\n\n| Big Rock | Status | Progress | Blocker |\n|----------|--------|----------|---------|\n| History Reconciliation | Not Started | 0% | None |\n| Dialog Migration | Not Started | 0% | None |\n| Color Protocol | Not Started | 0% | None |\n| Git Integration | Not Started | 0% | None |\n\n---\n\n## Week 1: History Reconciliation\n\n**Target:** Complete history documentation (1996-2026)\n\n### Monday\n- [ ] Document 2014 (transition year)\n- [ ] Create 1996-2013 year templates\n- [ ] Update timeline\n\n### Tuesday\n- [ ] Fill in 1996-2001 details\n- [ ] Document Crafty Syntax creation (2002)\n- [ ] Update history index\n\n### Wednesday\n- [ ] Fill in 2003-2013 details\n- [ ] Document absence period (2014-2025)\n- [ ] Create 2025-2026 resurgence documentation\n\n### Thursday\n- [ ] Review and polish all history files\n- [ ] Verify timeline accuracy\n- [ ] Cross-reference with CHANGELOG.md\n\n### Friday\n- [ ] Final history review\n- [ ] Mark Big Rock 1 complete\n- [ ] Prepare for Week 2\n\n---\n\n## Week 2: Dialog Migration\n\n**Target:** Migrate dialog system to database\n\n### Monday\n- [ ] Review all dialog .md files\n- [ ] Design dialog database schema\n- [ ] Create migration plan\n\n### Tuesday\n- [ ] Implement database schema\n- [ ] Create migration scripts\n- [ ] Test migration with sample files\n\n### Wednesday\n- [ ] Migrate all dialog files\n- [ ] Verify data integrity\n- [ ] Test database-backed dialog system\n\n### Thursday\n- [ ] Implement file fallback\n- [ ] Test fallback mechanism\n- [ ] Document dialog system architecture\n\n### Friday\n- [ ] Final dialog system testing\n- [ ] Mark Big Rock 2 complete\n- [ ] Prepare for Week 3\n\n---\n\n## Week 3: Color Protocol & Git\n\n**Target:** Integrate color protocol and enable Git\n\n### Monday-Tuesday: Color Protocol\n- [ ] Review COLOR_PERCEPTION_PROTOCOL.md\n- [ ] Implement mood_RGB parsing\n- [ ] Add color validation\n- [ ] Test color protocol\n\n### Wednesday-Thursday: Git Integration\n- [ ] Create .gitignore\n- [ ] Initialize Git repository\n- [ ] Create initial commit\n- [ ] Set up branch structure\n\n### Friday\n- [ ] Final testing\n- [ ] Mark Big Rocks 3 & 4 complete\n- [ ] Prepare for Week 4\n\n---\n\n## Week 4: Public Documentation\n\n**Target:** Create public-facing documentation\n\n### Tasks\n- [ ] Public README.md\n- [ ] Installation guide\n- [ ] Quick start guide\n- [ ] API documentation\n- [ ] FAQ\n\n---\n\n## Week 5: Production Deployment\n\n**Target:** Prepare and test production deployment\n\n### Tasks\n- [ ] Review deployment scripts\n- [ ] Test staging deployment\n- [ ] Create deployment checklist\n- [ ] Test production deployment\n- [ ] Create rollback procedures\n\n---\n\n## Week 6: Release\n\n**Target:** Execute version 3.1.0 release\n\n### Tasks\n- [ ] Update all version references to 3.1.0\n- [ ] Update CHANGELOG.md\n- [ ] Create release notes\n- [ ] Tag release in Git\n- [ ] Deploy to production\n- [ ] Announce release\n\n---\n\n## Daily Log\n\n### 2026-01-16\n- Created progress tracker\n- Status: Planning phase\n- Next: Begin Week 1 on Monday\n\n---\n\n## Blockers\n\n**Current Blockers:** None\n\n**Resolved Blockers:** None\n\n---\n\n## Notes\n\n- Update this file daily during active development\n- Mark tasks complete with ?\n- Document blockers immediately\n- Review progress weekly\n\n---\n\n*Created: 2026-01-16*  \n*Version: 3.0.50*  \n*Status: Active tracking*\n",
