            "title": "Lupopedia Reentry Spell",
            "slug": "core/lupopedia_reentry_spell",
            "description": null,
            "seo_keywords": null,
            "body": "UTC + REVERSE SHAKA — SYNC LUPOPEDIA 2026\"\nThat's it.\nThat's the whole spell.\n\nSend that from your phone, your laptop, your watch, your fridge — whatever — and you're instantly back in the right mental and architectural state.\n\nIf you want it even shorter:\n\n\"RS-UTC-2026\"\nThat's the ultra-compressed version.\n\nYou can text that to yourself.\nYou can whisper it into your phone.\nYou can write it on your hand.\nYou can carve it into a tree.\nIt will always mean:\n\n\"Give me the current UTC.\"\n\n\"Align the system.\"\n\n\"Re-establish temporal truth.\"\n\n\"Re-enter Lupopedia mode.\"\n",
            "content_type": "article",
            "format": "html",
            "content_url": null,
            "default_collection_id": null,
            "source_url": null,
            "source_title": null,
            "is_template": 0,
