        {
            "content_id": 2308,
            "content_parent_id": null,
            "federation_node_id": 1,
            "group_id": null,
            "user_id": 1,
            "title": "Gov Prohibit 007",
            "slug": "doctrine/gov-prohibit-007",
            "description": null,
            "seo_keywords": null,
            "body": "# GOV-PROHIBIT-007: RESERVED FOR EMERGENCY PROTOCOL\n\n**Series:** GOV-PROHIBIT-007. **Index:** [GOV-PROHIBIT-000](GOV-PROHIBIT-000.md). *(See also: [GOV-PROHIBIT-000](GOV-PROHIBIT-000.md) through [GOV-PROHIBIT-006](GOV-PROHIBIT-006.md).)*\n\n## Status: INCEPTION_PENDING\n\n## Purpose\nReserved for emergency governance addressing unforeseen threats. For the thing we haven't imagined yet.\n\n## Current State\n- No prohibition rules defined\n- No enforcement procedures defined\n- Activation: Real Human Captain Wolfie or Governance Council, per Emergency Override in [GOV-PROHIBIT-000](GOV-PROHIBIT-000.md)\n\n## When 007 May Be Invoked\n- Existential or structural threats not covered by 001–006\n- Novel failure modes requiring new doctrine at speed\n- Council-approved emergency doctrine\n\n## Affirmation\n\"For the unforeseen. GOV-PROHIBIT-007 stands reserved.\"\n",
            "content_type": "article",
            "format": "html",
            "content_url": null,
            "default_collection_id": null,
