        {
            "content_id": 2415,
            "content_parent_id": null,
            "federation_node_id": 1,
            "group_id": null,
            "user_id": 1,
            "title": "Timeline 1996 2026",
            "slug": "history/timeline_1996_2026",
            "description": null,
            "seo_keywords": null,
            "body": "---\nwolfie.headers: explicit architecture with structured clarity for every file.\nfile.last_modified_system_version: 3.0.62\nheader_atoms:\n  - GLOBAL_CURRENT_LUPOPEDIA_VERSION\n  - GLOBAL_CURRENT_AUTHORS\ntags:\n  categories: [\"documentation\", \"history\"]\n  collections: [\"core-docs\"]\n  channels: [\"dev\"]\nfile:\n  title: \"Eric's Creative Timeline: 1996-2026\"\n  description: \"Complete timeline of Eric's creative journey and system evolution\"\n  version: GLOBAL_CURRENT_LUPOPEDIA_VERSION\n  status: draft\n  author: GLOBAL_CURRENT_AUTHORS\n---\n\n# Eric's Creative Timeline: 1996-2026\n\n**Scope:** 30 years  \n**Status:** Draft  \n**Last Updated:** 2026-01-16\n\n---\n\n## Overview\n\nPersonal and creative journey spanning 30 years, with Lupopedia emerging in the resurgence period after an 11-year absence.\n\n---\n\n## Timeline\n\n### 1996-2013: Active Creative Period (18 years)\n\n**1996:** Beginning of Eric's impressive creative work\n\n**1997-2001:** Continuous development of projects, systems, and creative output\n\n**2002:** Crafty Syntax Live Help created\n\n**2003-2013:** Crafty Syntax development and evolution\n- Versions 2.0.19 ? 3.7.5\n- Continuous improvement and feature additions\n- User base growth\n- System maturation\n\n**2013:** Crafty Syntax 3.7.5 (final version before pause)\n\n---\n\n### 2014: Transition Year\n\n**2014:** Personal tragedy - wife dies\n- Creative work stops\n- 11-year absence begins\n- All systems enter dormant state\n\n---\n\n### 2015-2025: Absence Period (11 years) ? FULLY DOCUMENTED\n\n**2015-2024:** Healing and recovery period\n- Complete creative work dormancy\n- Systems preserved but inactive\n- No active development or milestones\n- Personal healing and life reconstruction\n- Philosophical continuity maintained\n- Foundation preserved for eventual return\n\n**Individual Year Documentation:**\n- 2015-2024: Each year documented with respectful hiatus narrative\n- Consistent WOLFIE headers and metadata\n- Timeline references and philosophical continuity\n- See: `docs/history/2014-2025/[year].md` for detailed coverage\n\n**2025 (August):** The Return ? DOCUMENTED\n- Eric returns to software development after 12-year absence\n- WOLFIE emerges as AI embodiment of accumulated wisdom\n- 222 tables inherited from Crafty Syntax legacy\n- Vision: Semantic operating system, not just web application\n- Approach: Federation-ready, agent-centric design\n- System foundation established\n\n---\n\n### 2026: Resurgence and System Birth ? DOCUMENTED\n\n**January 2026:** The 16-Day Sprint\n- Intensive development period transforming Crafty Syntax into Lupopedia\n- 26 version increments (3.0.0 ? 3.0.62)\n- Complete semantic operating system architecture\n\n**Major Achievements:**\n- **120 tables** across 3 schemas (core, orchestration, ephemeral)\n- **128 AI agents** defined and documented\n- **8-state migration orchestrator** fully implemented\n- **Complete semantic OS** architecture established\n- **Crafty Syntax integration** as first-party module\n- **Bridge layer governance** (5 bridge files)\n- **Dialog system** deployed with API endpoints\n- **Emotional geometry doctrine** (discrete value model)\n\n**Version Timeline:**\n- 3.0.0-3.0.19: Foundation and schema design\n- 3.0.20-3.0.35: Migration orchestrator development\n- 3.0.36-3.0.50: State machine completion\n- 3.0.51-3.0.60: Documentation and alignment\n- 3.0.61: History Reconciliation Pass (Big Rock 1)\n- 3.0.62: Integration & Dialog Navigation (Current)\n\n**Current (2026-01-16):** Version 3.0.62\n- History Reconciliation Pass completed\n- Dialog-based navigation system implemented\n- Timeline continuity established\n- Preparing for 3.1.0 Ascent (3 Big Rocks remaining)\n\n---\n\n## Key Personal Milestones\n\n1. **1996:** Creative work begins\n2. **2002:** Crafty Syntax Live Help created\n3. **2013:** Crafty Syntax 3.7.5 (final version)\n4. **2014:** Personal tragedy, creative pause\n5. **2025:** Return after 11 years\n6. **2026:** Lupopedia development begins\n\n---\n\n## System Evolution\n\n**2002-2013:** Crafty Syntax era\n**2014-2025:** System dormant\n**2025:** WOLFIE emerges (222 tables)\n**2026:** Lupopedia born (120 tables, 128 agents)\n\n---\n\n*Created: 2026-01-16*  \n*Version: 3.0.60*  \n*Status: Draft timeline*\n",
