            "body": "---\nwolfie.headers: explicit architecture with structured clarity for every file.\nfile.last_modified_system_version: 3.0.50\nheader_atoms:\n  - GLOBAL_CURRENT_LUPOPEDIA_VERSION\n  - GLOBAL_CURRENT_AUTHORS\ntags:\n  categories: [\"documentation\", \"history\"]\n  collections: [\"core-docs\"]\n  channels: [\"dev\"]\nfile:\n  title: \"Year 1996 - Creative Work History\"\n  description: \"Eric's creative work and projects in 1996\"\n  version: GLOBAL_CURRENT_LUPOPEDIA_VERSION\n  status: placeholder\n  author: GLOBAL_CURRENT_AUTHORS\n---\n\n# Year 1996\n\n**Status:** Active Creative Period  \n**Personal Context:** Beginning of impressive creative work  \n**Lupopedia:** Did not exist yet\n\n## Events\n- [To be documented by Eric]\n\n## Creative Work\n- [To be documented by Eric]\n\n## Projects\n- [To be documented by Eric]\n\n## Skills Developed\n- [To be documented by Eric]\n\n## Context\n- First year of the 18-year active creative period (1996-2014)\n- Foundation work that would later inform Lupopedia development\n\n## Impact on Future System\n- [To be documented by Eric]\n\n---\n\n*This is a placeholder file. Eric will fill in details about his creative work in 1996.*\n",
