            "body": "---\nwolfie.headers: explicit architecture with structured clarity for every file.\nfile.last_modified_system_version: 3.0.50\nheader_atoms:\n  - GLOBAL_CURRENT_LUPOPEDIA_VERSION\n  - GLOBAL_CURRENT_AUTHORS\ntags:\n  categories: [\"documentation\", \"history\"]\n  collections: [\"core-docs\"]\n  channels: [\"dev\"]\nfile:\n  title: \"Years 1997-2001 - Creative Work History\"\n  description: \"Eric's creative work and projects from 1997-2001\"\n  version: GLOBAL_CURRENT_LUPOPEDIA_VERSION\n  status: placeholder\n  author: GLOBAL_CURRENT_AUTHORS\n---\n\n# Years 1997-2001\n\n**Status:** Active Creative Period  \n**Personal Context:** Early development phase  \n**Lupopedia:** Did not exist yet\n\n## 1997\n\n### Events\n- [To be documented by Eric]\n\n### Creative Work\n- [To be documented by Eric]\n\n---\n\n## 1998\n\n### Events\n- [To be documented by Eric]\n\n### Creative Work\n- [To be documented by Eric]\n\n---\n\n## 1999\n\n### Events\n- [To be documented by Eric]\n\n### Creative Work\n- [To be documented by Eric]\n\n---\n\n## 2000\n\n### Events\n- [To be documented by Eric]\n\n### Creative Work\n- [To be documented by Eric]\n\n---\n\n## 2001\n\n### Events\n- [To be documented by Eric]\n\n### Creative Work\n- [To be documented by Eric]\n\n---\n\n## Period Summary (1997-2001)\n\n### Overall Context\n- Years 2-6 of the 18-year active creative period\n- Foundation building for future systems\n\n### Skills Developed\n- [To be documented by Eric]\n\n### Projects\n- [To be documented by Eric]\n\n### Impact on Future System\n- [To be documented by Eric]\n\n---\n\n*This is a placeholder file. Eric will fill in details about his creative work from 1997-2001.*\n",
