            "body": "---\nwolfie.headers: explicit architecture with structured clarity for every file.\nfile.last_modified_system_version: 3.0.50\nheader_atoms:\n  - GLOBAL_CURRENT_LUPOPEDIA_VERSION\n  - GLOBAL_CURRENT_AUTHORS\ntags:\n  categories: [\"documentation\", \"history\"]\n  collections: [\"core-docs\"]\n  channels: [\"dev\"]\nfile:\n  title: \"Years 2003-2013 - Crafty Syntax Era\"\n  description: \"Eric's creative work from 2003-2013, Crafty Syntax development era\"\n  version: GLOBAL_CURRENT_LUPOPEDIA_VERSION\n  status: placeholder\n  author: GLOBAL_CURRENT_AUTHORS\n---\n\n# Years 2003-2013 - Crafty Syntax Era\n\n**Status:** Active Creative Period  \n**Personal Context:** Crafty Syntax development and evolution  \n**Crafty Syntax:** Active development (versions 2.0.19 ? 3.7.5)  \n**Lupopedia:** Did not exist yet\n\n## 2003\n\n### Events\n- [To be documented by Eric]\n\n### Crafty Syntax Development\n- [To be documented by Eric]\n\n---\n\n## 2004\n\n### Events\n- [To be documented by Eric]\n\n### Crafty Syntax Development\n- [To be documented by Eric]\n\n---\n\n## 2005\n\n### Events\n- [To be documented by Eric]\n\n### Crafty Syntax Development\n- [To be documented by Eric]\n\n---\n\n## 2006\n\n### Events\n- [To be documented by Eric]\n\n### Crafty Syntax Development\n- [To be documented by Eric]\n\n---\n\n## 2007\n\n### Events\n- [To be documented by Eric]\n\n### Crafty Syntax Development\n- [To be documented by Eric]\n\n---\n\n## 2008\n\n### Events\n- [To be documented by Eric]\n\n### Crafty Syntax Development\n- [To be documented by Eric]\n\n---\n\n## 2009\n\n### Events\n- [To be documented by Eric]\n\n### Crafty Syntax Development\n- [To be documented by Eric]\n\n---\n\n## 2010\n\n### Events\n- [To be documented by Eric]\n\n### Crafty Syntax Development\n- [To be documented by Eric]\n\n---\n\n## 2011\n\n### Events\n- [To be documented by Eric]\n\n### Crafty Syntax Development\n- [To be documented by Eric]\n\n---\n\n## 2012\n\n### Events\n- [To be documented by Eric]\n\n### Crafty Syntax Development\n- [To be documented by Eric]\n\n---\n\n## 2013\n\n### Events\n- **Crafty Syntax version 3.7.5 (final version before pause)**\n- [Additional events to be documented by Eric]\n\n### Crafty Syntax Development\n- Final active development year before 2014 transition\n- [Additional details to be documented by Eric]\n\n---\n\n## Period Summary (2003-2013)\n\n### Overall Context\n- Years 8-18 of the 18-year active creative period\n- Crafty Syntax development and maturation\n- Final year (2013) before 2014 transition\n\n### Major Milestones\n- Crafty Syntax evolution from early versions to 3.7.5\n- [Additional milestones to be documented by Eric]\n\n### Skills Developed\n- [To be documented by Eric]\n\n### Projects\n- Crafty Syntax Live Help (primary focus)\n- [Additional projects to be documented by Eric]\n\n### Impact on Future System\n- Crafty Syntax 3.7.5 becomes the foundation for Lupopedia integration\n- Technical patterns and architecture inform 2026 resurgence\n- [Additional impact to be documented by Eric]\n\n---\n\n*This is a placeholder file. Eric will fill in details about his creative work from 2003-2013, especially Crafty Syntax development.*\n",
