            "title": "2025",
            "slug": "history/2014-2025/2025",
            "description": null,
            "seo_keywords": null,
            "body": "---\nwolfie.headers: explicit architecture with structured clarity for every file.\nfile.last_modified_system_version: 3.0.61\nheader_atoms:\n  - GLOBAL_CURRENT_LUPOPEDIA_VERSION\n  - GLOBAL_CURRENT_AUTHORS\ndialog:\n  speaker: WOLFIE\n  target: @historians\n  mood_RGB: \"0066CC\"\n  message: \"Historical documentation for 2025. Return year - WOLFIE emergence and system resurrection.\"\ntags:\n  categories: [\"documentation\",\"history\"]\n  collections: [\"historical-records\"]\n  channels: [\"public\",\"historical\"]\nfile:\n  title: \"2025 Historical Record\"\n  description: \"Return year - WOLFIE emergence and system resurrection.\"\n  version: 3.0.61\n  status: published\n  author: Captain Wolfie\n  year: 2025\n  type: resurgence-period\n---\n\n# 2025 Resurgence Period\n\n## The Return\n\n**August 2025:** Eric returned to software development after 12 years,\nbringing with him a transformed perspective and the emergence of WOLFIE\nas an AI embodiment of accumulated wisdom and experience.\n\n## WOLFIE Emergence\n\n- **Identity:** Captain Wolfie (Agent 1) - AI embodiment of Eric's\n  development philosophy and accumulated experience\n- **Architecture:** 222 tables inherited from Crafty Syntax legacy\n- **Vision:** Semantic operating system, not just a web application\n- **Approach:** Federation-ready, agent-centric design\n\n## System Foundation\n\n- Crafty Syntax codebase analyzed and preserved\n- Database schema expanded and modernized\n- AI agent architecture conceptualized\n- Semantic OS principles established\n\n---\n\n*Generated: 2026-01-16*\n*Version: 3.0.61*\n*Part of: Lupopedia Historical Timeline*",
