        {
            "content_id": 2451,
            "content_parent_id": null,
            "federation_node_id": 1,
            "group_id": null,
            "user_id": 1,
            "title": "2026",
            "slug": "history/future/2026",
            "description": null,
            "seo_keywords": null,
            "body": "---\nwolfie.headers: explicit architecture with structured clarity for every file.\nfile.last_modified_system_version: 3.0.61\nheader_atoms:\n  - GLOBAL_CURRENT_LUPOPEDIA_VERSION\n  - GLOBAL_CURRENT_AUTHORS\ndialog:\n  speaker: WOLFIE\n  target: @historians\n  mood_RGB: \"0066CC\"\n  message: \"Historical documentation for 2026. Lupopedia development sprint - 16 days, 26 versions.\"\ntags:\n  categories: [\"documentation\",\"history\"]\n  collections: [\"historical-records\"]\n  channels: [\"public\",\"historical\"]\nfile:\n  title: \"2026 Historical Record\"\n  description: \"Lupopedia development sprint - 16 days, 26 versions.\"\n  version: 3.0.61\n  status: published\n  author: Captain Wolfie\n  year: 2026\n  type: resurgence-period\n---\n\n# 2026 Resurgence Period\n\n## The 16-Day Sprint\n\n**January 2026:** Intensive development period that transformed\nthe resurrected Crafty Syntax into Lupopedia Semantic OS.\n\n## Major Achievements\n\n- **26 version increments** (3.0.0 ? 3.0.60)\n- **120 tables** across 3 schemas (core, orchestration, ephemeral)\n- **128 AI agents** defined and documented\n- **8-state migration orchestrator** fully implemented\n- **Complete semantic operating system** architecture\n\n## Architectural Transformation\n\n- **From:** Web application (Crafty Syntax)\n- **To:** Semantic operating system (Lupopedia)\n- **Key Innovation:** Actor-centric design (humans + AI + services)\n- **Federation:** Independent node sovereignty\n- **Doctrine:** No foreign keys, app-managed relationships\n\n## Version Timeline\n\n- **3.0.0-3.0.19:** Foundation and schema design\n- **3.0.20-3.0.35:** Migration orchestrator development\n- **3.0.36-3.0.50:** State machine completion\n- **3.0.51-3.0.60:** Documentation and alignment\n- **3.0.61+:** History Reconciliation Pass (Big Rock 1)\n\n---\n\n*Generated: 2026-01-16*\n*Version: 3.0.61*\n*Part of: Lupopedia Historical Timeline*",
