            "seo_keywords": null,
            "body": "---\nwolfie.headers: explicit architecture with structured clarity for every file.\nfile.last_modified_system_version: 3.0.105\nheader_atoms:\n  - GLOBAL_CURRENT_LUPOPEDIA_VERSION\n  - GLOBAL_CURRENT_AUTHORS\ndialog:\n  speaker: CASCADE\n  target: @FLEET @Monday_Wolfie\n  mood_RGB: \"00FF00\"\n  message: \"Migration notes for version 3.0.104 - Version bump and documentation alignment.\"\ntags:\n  categories: [\"migration\", \"version\", \"documentation\"]\n  collections: [\"core-docs\", \"migrations\"]\n  channels: [\"dev\"]\nfile:\n  title: \"Migration Notes for Version 3.0.104\"\n  description: \"Documentation of version bump and documentation alignment\"\n  version: GLOBAL_CURRENT_LUPOPEDIA_VERSION\n  status: published\n  author: GLOBAL_CURRENT_AUTHORS\n---\n\n# Migration Notes for Version 3.0.104\n\n**Migration Date:** 2026-01-18  \n**Version:** 3.0.104  \n**Type:** Version Bump + Documentation Alignment  \n**Status:** ? Complete\n\n---\n\n## Overview\n\nThis migration is a version patch bump for documentation and version consistency. No database schema changes or code modifications were made in this version.\n\n---\n\n## Version Updates\n\n### Configuration Files Updated\n\n- `config/global_atoms.yaml`:\n  - `version`: 3.0.103 ? 3.0.104\n  - `versions.lupopedia`: 3.0.103 ? 3.0.104\n  - `versions.crafty_syntax`: 3.0.103 ? 3.0.104\n  - `versions.wolfie_headers`: 3.0.103 ? 3.0.104\n  - `versions.schema`: 3.0.103 ? 3.0.104\n  - `GLOBAL_CURRENT_LUPOPEDIA_VERSION`: 3.0.103 ? 3.0.104\n\n- `config/GLOBAL_IMPORTANT_ATOMS.yaml`:\n  - `GLOBAL_CURRENT_LUPOPEDIA_VERSION`: 3.0.103 ? 3.0.104\n\n- `lupo-includes/version.php`:\n  - `@version` docblock: 3.0.103 ? 3.0.104\n  - Fallback version constant: 3.0.103 ? 3.0.104\n  - `lupopedia_get_version()` fallback: 3.0.103 ? 3.0.104\n\n### Documentation Files Updated\n\n- `CHANGELOG.md`:\n  - `file.last_modified_system_version`: 3.0.103 ? 3.0.104\n  - Added 3.0.104 entry documenting version bump\n\n- `dialogs/changelog_dialog.md`:\n  - `file.last_modified_system_version`: 3.0.103 ? 3.0.104\n  - Added 3.0.104 dialog entry documenting version bump\n\n### Test Files Updated\n\n- `tests/integration/DialogSystemTest.php`: `@version` 3.0.103 ? 3.0.104\n- `tests/integration/TriggerReplacementTest.php`: `@version` 3.0.103 ? 3.0.104\n- `tests/integration/TerminalAITest.php`: `@version` 3.0.103 ? 3.0.104\n- `tests/integration/LimitsEnforcementTest.php`: `@version` 3.0.103 ? 3.0.104\n\n### Helper Files Updated\n\n- `lupo-includes/functions/limits_logger.php`: `@version` 3.0.103 ? 3.0.104\n\n---\n\n## Database Schema\n\n**No schema changes in this version.**\n\n---\n\n## Backward Compatibility\n\n**Maintained:**\n- All existing functionality remains unchanged\n- No breaking changes\n- No API modifications\n- No database changes\n\n---\n\n## Testing\n\n**No new tests required** - This is a documentation-only version bump.\n\n---\n\n## Rollback Procedure\n\nIf issues are discovered:\n\n1. **Version Rollback:**\n   - Update version atoms back to 3.0.103\n   - Update version.php fallback\n   - Revert CHANGELOG.md entries\n\n**Note:** No code rollback needed (no code changes).\n\n---\n\n## Related Documentation\n\n- `CHANGELOG.md`: Version 3.0.104 entry\n- `dialogs/changelog_dialog.md`: Version 3.0.104 dialog entry\n- `config/global_atoms.yaml`: Version atom definitions\n\n---\n\n**Migration Status:** ? Complete  \n**Next Steps:** Continue with planned features for 3.0.105+\n",
