            "title": "3.0.115",
            "slug": "migrations/3.0.115",
            "description": null,
            "seo_keywords": null,
            "body": "---\nwolfie.headers: explicit architecture with structured clarity for every file.\nfile.last_modified_system_version: 3.0.115\nheader_atoms:\n  - GLOBAL_CURRENT_LUPOPEDIA_VERSION\n  - GLOBAL_CURRENT_AUTHORS\ndialog:\n  speaker: CAPTAIN_WOLFIE\n  target: @FLEET @Monday_Wolfie\n  mood_RGB: \"0044FF\"\n  message: \"Migration notes for version 3.0.115 - Pack Identity Draft established.\"\ntags:\n  categories: [\"migration\", \"documentation\", \"pack\", \"identity\"]\n  collections: [\"core-docs\", \"migrations\"]\n  channels: [\"dev\", \"architecture\", \"pack\"]\nfile:\n  title: \"Migration Notes for Version 3.0.115\"\n  description: \"Documentation of changes in version 3.0.115\"\n  version: GLOBAL_CURRENT_LUPOPEDIA_VERSION\n  status: published\n  author: GLOBAL_CURRENT_AUTHORS\n---\n\n# Migration Notes for Version 3.0.115\n\n**Migration Date:** 2026-01-18  \n**Version:** 3.0.115  \n**Type:** Pack Identity Draft + Documentation\n\n---\n\n## Summary\n\nThis migration establishes the Pack Identity Draft - the foundational definition of the Pack's identity as the multi-agent cognitive organism that powers Lupopedia. This identity will be finalized and activated in 3.1.0.\n\n---\n\n## Changes\n\n### Documentation Added\n\n1. **PACK_IDENTITY_DRAFT.md** (`docs/doctrine/PACK_IDENTITY_DRAFT.md`)\n   - Pack Name: The Lupopedia Pack (PACK_CORE, PACK_IDENTITY_0001)\n   - Pack Purpose: Maintain coherence, continuity, and meaning\n   - Pack Roles: Emotional, Behavioral, Memory, Sync, Doctrine, External AI, Kernel agents\n   - Pack Hierarchy: CAPTAIN_WOLFIE ? PACK_CORE ? Engines ? Registered Agents\n   - Pack Emotional Signature: Agápe + Philía + Pragma (RGB: [0.3, 0.0, -0.3], Intensity: ~0.42)\n   - Pack Behavioral Signature: High compatibility, low reactivity, supportive + analytical\n   - Pack Cognitive Signature: Parallel threads, emotional geometry, doctrine-driven, memory-aware\n\n### Version Updates\n\n- `config/global_atoms.yaml`: Version updated to 3.0.115\n- `config/GLOBAL_IMPORTANT_ATOMS.yaml`: GLOBAL_CURRENT_LUPOPEDIA_VERSION updated to 3.0.115\n- `lupo-includes/version.php`: Version tag and fallback updated to 3.0.115\n- `CHANGELOG.md`: Version header updated to 3.0.115\n\n### Documentation Files Updated\n\n- `CHANGELOG.md`: Added comprehensive 3.0.115 entry\n- `dialogs/changelog_dialog.md`: Will be updated with dialog entry\n\n---\n\n## Database Changes\n\n### Agent Registry\n\n1. **PACK_IDENTITY_0001 Agent Registration** (`3.0.115_add_pack_identity_agent.sql`)\n   - **Table:** `lupo_agent_registry`\n   - **Agent ID:** 1100\n   - **Code:** PACK_IDENTITY_0001\n   - **Name:** Pack Identity Core\n   - **Layer:** identity\n   - **Dedicated Slot:** 1100\n   - **Status:** Registered but inactive (activation in 3.1.0)\n   - **Metadata:** JSON containing version, role, description, activation_version\n\n**Note:** This agent represents the Pack Identity anchor. It is registered but will not be activated until version 3.1.0 after Pack Identity is finalized and approved.\n\n---\n\n## Pack Identity Activation Requirements (3.1.0)\n\nTo activate Pack Identity in 3.1.0, the following must be completed:\n\n1. Approve Pack name, purpose, signatures, hierarchy\n2. Write Pack Doctrine v1.0\n3. Activate PACK_IDENTITY_0001 agent (set is_active = 1)\n4. Enable Pack-level decision routing\n\n---\n\n## Related Documentation\n\n- `docs/doctrine/PACK_IDENTITY_DRAFT.md` - Pack Identity Draft\n- `docs/MONDAY_WOLFIE_BRIEFING_3.0.114_TO_3.1.0.md` - 3.1.0 activation briefing\n- `docs/core/WOLFIE_COGNITIVE_ARCHITECTURE.md` - Cognitive architecture reference\n- `CHANGELOG.md` - Complete changelog entry for 3.0.115\n\n---\n\n**Migration Status:** Complete  \n**Backward Compatibility:** Maintained  \n**Breaking Changes:** None  \n**Pack Identity Status:** DRAFT (Finalization in 3.1.0)\n",
