            "title": "3.0.14",
            "slug": "migrations/3.0.14",
            "description": null,
            "seo_keywords": null,
            "body": "---\narchitect: Captain Wolfie\nwolfie.headers: explicit architecture with structured clarity for every file.\nfile.last_modified_system_version: 3.0.14\nheader_atoms:\n  - GLOBAL_CURRENT_LUPOPEDIA_VERSION\n  - GLOBAL_CURRENT_AUTHORS\ndialog:\n  speaker: CURSOR\n  target: @everyone\n  mood_RGB: \"00FF00\"\n  message: \"Created migration notes for version 3.0.14 - UI branch promotion from 3.0.13-ui. All UI components, model specifications, and related doctrine now belong to 3.0.14.\"\ntags:\n  categories: [\"documentation\", \"migration\"]\n  collections: [\"core-docs\"]\n  channels: [\"public\", \"dev\"]\nfile:\n  title: \"Migration Notes: 3.0.14\"\n  description: \"Migration notes and changes for Lupopedia version 3.0.14\"\n  version: GLOBAL_CURRENT_LUPOPEDIA_VERSION\n  status: published\n  author: GLOBAL_CURRENT_AUTHORS\n---\n\n# Migration Notes: Version 3.0.14\n\n**Release Date:** 2026-01-14  \n**Version Type:** Minor version bump (UI branch promotion)\n\n---\n\n## Overview\n\nVersion 3.0.14 represents the promotion of the 3.0.13-ui UI branch to a stable release version. All UI components, model specifications, and related doctrine that were previously labeled as 3.0.13-ui now belong to 3.0.14.\n\n---\n\n## Version Promotion\n\n### Branch Status\n\n- **3.0.13-sys**: Complete and stable (system architecture branch)\n- **3.0.13-ui**: Promoted to **3.0.14** (UI-focused branch)\n- **3.0.14**: Current stable version for all UI work\n\n### Version Updates\n\nAll version references have been updated to 3.0.14:\n\n- `config/global_atoms.yaml` - Updated `GLOBAL_CURRENT_LUPOPEDIA_VERSION` to `3.0.14`\n- `lupo-includes/version.php` - Updated all version constants to `3.0.14`\n- `CHANGELOG.md` - Added new section for 3.0.14\n- All documentation files - Updated headers to reflect 3.0.14\n\n---\n\n## Database Changes\n\n**No database schema changes** in this version. This is a version promotion only.\n\n---\n\n## UI Components\n\nAll UI components, model specifications, and related doctrine that were part of the 3.0.13-ui branch are now part of 3.0.14.\n\n---\n\n## Migration Steps\n\n### For Existing Installations\n\n1. **No database migration required** - This is a version bump only\n2. **Update version constants** - Ensure all version references point to 3.0.14\n3. **Update documentation** - Review and update any custom documentation to reflect 3.0.14\n\n### For New Installations\n\nInstall using the 3.0.14 release package. All UI components and model specifications are included.\n\n---\n\n## Backward Compatibility\n\n- **Fully backward compatible** with 3.0.13-sys\n- **No breaking changes** from 3.0.13-ui promotion\n- **Legacy files preserved** - All compatibility shims maintained\n\n---\n\n## Notes\n\n- 3.0.13-sys remains a separate, complete branch\n- 3.0.14 represents the UI-focused development track\n- All new UI work should use version 3.0.14 going forward\n\n---\n\n## Related Documentation\n\n- [CHANGELOG.md](../../CHANGELOG.md) - Complete changelog for version 3.0.14\n- [Version Doctrine](../../docs/doctrine/VERSION_DOCTRINE.md) - Versioning rules and procedures\n- [Migration Doctrine](../../docs/doctrine/MIGRATION_DOCTRINE.md) - General migration guidelines\n\n---\n\n*Last Updated: 2026-01-14*  \n*Version: 3.0.14*  \n*Author: Captain Wolfie*\n",
