            "title": "3.0.50",
            "slug": "migrations/3.0.50",
            "description": null,
            "seo_keywords": null,
            "body": "---\nwolfie.headers: explicit architecture with structured clarity for every file.\nfile.last_modified_system_version: 3.0.50\nheader_atoms:\n  - GLOBAL_CURRENT_LUPOPEDIA_VERSION\n  - GLOBAL_CURRENT_AUTHORS\ndialog:\n  speaker: CAPTAIN_WOLFIE\n  target: @everyone\n  mood_RGB: \"FFAA00\"\n  message: \"Version correction: 3.0.50 for Friday Wolfie madness tracking. Snack-Smacks hybrid mode activated. Emotional geometry doctrine updated, version references corrected from premature 3.1.0 jump.\"\ntags:\n  categories: [\"documentation\", \"migrations\"]\n  collections: [\"core-docs\"]\n  channels: [\"dev\", \"public\"]\nfile:\n  title: \"Migration Notes - Version 3.0.50\"\n  description: \"Migration notes and changes for Lupopedia version 3.0.50 - Friday Wolfie madness version correction\"\n  version: GLOBAL_CURRENT_LUPOPEDIA_VERSION\n  status: published\n  author: GLOBAL_CURRENT_AUTHORS\n---\n\n# Migration Notes - Version 3.0.50\n\n**Release Date:** 2026-01-16  \n**Version:** 3.0.50  \n**Type:** Version Correction (Friday Wolfie Madness)\n\n---\n\n## Overview\n\nVersion 3.0.50 is a version correction release that corrects premature version references from 3.1.0 back to the 3.0.x series. This version specifically tracks \"Friday Wolfie madness\" - chaotic but productive development sessions that require special version treatment within the 3.0.x series rather than jumping to a major version.\n\n**Snack-Smacks Hybrid Doctrine:**\n- **Snacks Component:** Sustainable velocity, documentation discipline\n- **Smacks Component:** Chaotic version jumps, Friday energy\n- **Hybrid Rule:** Documentation precision amidst chaotic creativity\n\n---\n\n## Changes Summary\n\n### 1. Version Correction Sequence\n\n**Rationale:** Friday development sessions get special version treatment in the 3.0.x series. Major version jumps (3.1.0) require more ceremony and should not be triggered by single-session work.\n\n**Files Updated:**\n- `docs/doctrine/EMOTIONAL_GEOMETRY.md` - Updated to 3.0.50\n- `docs/doctrine/EMOTIONAL_GEOMETRY_THREE_AXIS_MODEL_2026.md` - Updated to 3.0.50\n- `config/global_atoms.yaml` - Updated `GLOBAL_CURRENT_LUPOPEDIA_VERSION` to 3.0.50\n- `lupo-includes/version.php` - Updated version constants to 3.0.50\n- `dialogs/changelog_dialog.md` - Corrected 3.1.0 references to 3.0.50\n\n**Migration Required:** None (version metadata only)\n\n---\n\n### 2. Emotional Geometry Doctrine Update\n\n**Status:** Already documented in 3.0.46, version header corrected to 3.0.50\n\n**Doctrine:** Three-Axis Discrete Value Model (2026 Update)\n- Discrete values: `{-1, 0, 1}` mapping to `{false, unknown, true}`\n- Machine-safe encoding for emotional geometry\n- Replaces continuous gradient interpretations\n\n**Migration Required:** None (documentation only)\n\n---\n\n## Version Timeline Correction\n\n**Original Timeline:**\n- 3.0.46 ? 3.1.0 (premature jump)\n\n**Corrected Timeline:**\n- 3.0.46 ? 3.0.50 (Friday Wolfie madness preserved)\n- Future: 3.0.51+ or 3.1.0 when truly ready\n\n**Rationale:** Friday development sessions get special version treatment in the 3.0.x series. Major version jumps require more ceremony.\n\n---\n\n## Doctrine Compliance\n\nAll changes maintain 100% doctrine compliance:\n- ? Version Atom Doctrine: Single source of truth (`GLOBAL_CURRENT_LUPOPEDIA_VERSION`)\n- ? WOLFIE Headers: All updated with correct version\n- ? Documentation consistency: Version references aligned\n\n---\n\n## Backward Compatibility\n\n**100% Backward Compatible:**\n- No breaking changes\n- No schema changes\n- No code changes\n- Version metadata correction only\n\n---\n\n## Deployment Notes\n\n**For Staging/Production Deployment:**\n\n1. **No Database Migration Required** - Version metadata only\n2. **Deploy Updated Files:**\n   - `config/global_atoms.yaml` (version atom)\n   - `lupo-includes/version.php` (version constants)\n   - Doctrine files (version headers)\n3. **Verify:**\n   - Version atom resolves to 3.0.50\n   - All version references consistent\n\n---\n\n## Testing Recommendations\n\n1. **Version Consistency:** Verify `GLOBAL_CURRENT_LUPOPEDIA_VERSION` atom resolves to 3.0.50\n2. **Documentation:** Verify all WOLFIE Headers updated to 3.0.50\n3. **Version Functions:** Test `lupopedia_get_version()` returns 3.0.50\n\n---\n\n## Rollback Plan\n\n**If Issues Occur:**\n\n1. **Version Rollback:** Revert `config/global_atoms.yaml` version to 3.0.46\n2. **File Rollback:** Revert version.php and doctrine file headers\n3. **Dialog Rollback:** Revert dialog entries if needed\n\n---\n\n## Related Documentation\n\n- **Versioning Doctrine:** See `docs/doctrine/VERSION_DOCTRINE.md`\n- **Emotional Geometry:** See `docs/doctrine/EMOTIONAL_GEOMETRY.md`\n- **Changelog:** See `CHANGELOG.md` for complete change history\n\n---\n\n**Migration Status:** ? Version correction complete  \n**Deployment Risk:** None (metadata only)  \n**Testing Status:** Ready for validation\n",
