            "body": "---\nwolfie.headers: explicit architecture with structured clarity for every file.\nfile.last_modified_system_version: 3.1.13\nfile.last_modified_utc: 20260120170000\nfile.utc_day: 20260120\nfile.name: \"3.1.13.md\"\nGOV-AD-PROHIBIT-001: true\nheader_atoms:\n  - GLOBAL_CURRENT_LUPOPEDIA_VERSION\n  - GLOBAL_CURRENT_AUTHORS\ntemporal_edges:\n  actor_identity: \"Eric (Captain Wolfie)\"\n  system_context: \"Schema Freeze Active / 181 tables at ceiling\"\ndialog:\n  speaker: CURSOR\n  target: @CAPTAIN_WOLFIE @FLEET\n  mood_RGB: \"00FF00\"\n  message: \"3.1.13: Full System + Bridge Status Report. Version bump 3.1.12?3.1.13. No schema. No doctrine.\"\ntags:\n  categories: [\"migration\", \"documentation\", \"version\", \"status\"]\n  collections: [\"core-docs\", \"migrations\"]\n  channels: [\"dev\", \"internal\"]\nfile:\n  title: \"Migration Notes for Version 3.1.13\"\n  description: \"3.1.13: Full System + Bridge Status Report. Version bump. No database or schema changes.\"\n  version: GLOBAL_CURRENT_LUPOPEDIA_VERSION\n  status: published\n  author: GLOBAL_CURRENT_AUTHORS\nsystem_context:\n  schema_state: \"Frozen\"\n  table_count: 181\n  table_ceiling: 181\n  doctrine_mode: \"File-Sovereignty\"\n---\n\n# Migration Notes for Version 3.1.13\n\n**Date:** 2026-01-20  \n**Version:** 3.1.13  \n**Type:** Documentation, status report, version bump — **no database or schema changes**\n\n---\n\n## Summary\n\nPatch 3.1.13 adds a full SYSTEM_STATUS and BRIDGE_STATUS report to CHANGELOG and dialogs, confirms observability layer and TOON (181 tables), and bumps version atoms and `lupo-includes/version.php` from 3.1.12 to 3.1.13. No new tables, fields, constraints, or SQL migrations.\n\n---\n\n## Changes\n\n### Full System + Bridge Status Report\n- **SYSTEM_STATUS:** schema_state frozen, table_count 181/ceiling 181, sync_integrity clean, doctrine_mode File-Sovereignty, temporal_coherence monotonic, agent_health all operational, observability_layer active.\n- **BRIDGE_STATUS:** Active agents (SYSTEM, LILITH, CURSOR, CASCADE, MONDAY_WOLFIE, EXHUSBAND, ARA, STONED_WOLFIE), UTC anchor 20260119 03:25:15, current operations (dialog updates, TOON sync, TL;DR onboarding), bridge integrity stable, drift none.\n\n### Version (3.1.12 ? 3.1.13)\n- **config/global_atoms.yaml:** version, versions.lupopedia, GLOBAL_CURRENT_LUPOPEDIA_VERSION ? 3.1.13; last_updated 20260120.\n- **config/GLOBAL_IMPORTANT_ATOMS.yaml:** GLOBAL_CURRENT_LUPOPEDIA_VERSION ? 3.1.13.\n- **lupo-includes/version.php:** @version 3.1.13, fallback 3.1.13, lupopedia_get_version fallback 3.1.13.\n- **.cursorrules:** Current value 3.1.13.\n\n### Dialogs / Docs\n- **CHANGELOG.md:** §3.1.13 Full System Status + Bridge Status Report, Version subsection.\n- **dialogs/changelog_dialog.md:** CURSOR Version 3.1.13 (Version Bump), SYSTEM Full System + Bridge Status Report.\n- **dialogs/changelog_dialog-side.md:** Version 3.1.13 Sync, current_sync_state latest_version 3.1.13, system_status stable, bridge_status stable.\n\n### Database / Schema\n- **None.** No new tables, fields, or constraints. No TOON regeneration required for 3.1.13.\n\n---\n\n## Backward Compatibility\n\n- No legacy files removed. No compatibility shims changed. All changes additive (docs, dialogs, version atoms).\n",
