            "body": "---\nwolfie.headers: explicit architecture with structured clarity for every file.\nfile.name: \"docs/migrations/3.1.20.md\"\nfile.last_modified_system_version: 3.1.20\nfile.last_modified_utc: 20260120190000\nfile.utc_day: 20260120\nGOV-AD-PROHIBIT-001: true\nads_prohibition_statement: \"Ads are manipulation. Ads are disrespect. Ads violate user trust.\"\nUTC_TIMEKEEPER__CHANNEL_ID: \"dev\"\nheader_atoms:\n  - GLOBAL_CURRENT_LUPOPEDIA_VERSION: \"3.1.20\"\ntemporal_edges:\n  actor_identity: \"CASCADE\"\n  actor_location: \"Lupopedia Core\"\n  system_context: \"Version 3.1.20 Migration Notes\"\ndialog:\n  speaker: CASCADE\n  target: @CAPTAIN_WOLFIE @LILITH @ARA @CURSOR @SYSTEM\n  mood_RGB: \"00FF00\"\n  message: \"Version 3.1.20 migration notes documented.\"\ntags:\n  categories: [\"migration\", \"version\", \"documentation\"]\n  collections: [\"core-docs\", \"migrations\"]\n  channels: [\"dev\", \"versioning\"]\nfile:\n  name: \"Version 3.1.20 Migration Notes\"\n  title: \"Version 3.1.20 Migration Notes\"\n  description: \"Migration notes for version 3.1.20 patch bump\"\n  version: \"3.1.20\"\n  status: active\n  author: GLOBAL_CURRENT_AUTHORS\nsystem_context:\n  migration_type: \"version_patch\"\n  schema_changes: false\n  new_features: false\n---\n\n# Version 3.1.20 Migration Notes\n\n## Summary\nVersion 3.1.20 is a patch-level version bump with no schema changes or new features.\n\n## Changes Made\n\n### Version Updates\n- **config/global_atoms.yaml**: Updated `version` from \"3.1.18\" to \"3.1.20\"\n- **config/global_atoms.yaml**: Updated `versions.lupopedia` to \"3.1.20\"\n- **config/global_atoms.yaml**: Updated `GLOBAL_CURRENT_LUPOPEDIA_VERSION` to \"3.1.20\"\n- **lupo-includes/version.php**: Updated all version references to \"3.1.20\"\n  - `@version` docblock\n  - Fallback version constant\n  - `lupopedia_get_version()` fallback return value\n\n### Documentation Updates\n- **CHANGELOG.md**: Added version 3.1.20 entry\n- **dialogs/changelog_dialog.md**: Added version 3.1.20 entry\n- **dialogs/changelog_dialog-side.md**: Updated sync state to 3.1.20\n\n## Migration Requirements\n- **Database**: No changes required\n- **Files**: No new files required\n- **Configuration**: Version atoms updated automatically\n\n## Backward Compatibility\n- Fully backward compatible\n- No breaking changes\n- No schema modifications\n\n## Next Steps\n- Continue with normal operations\n- No additional migration steps required\n\n---\n\n**Documented by:** CASCADE  \n**Date:** 2026-01-20  \n**Version:** 3.1.20\n",
