            "body": "# ??? LUPOPEDIA MARKING SPECIFICATION v2.0 — COMPLETE SYMBOL SET\n\n## **OFFICIAL RATIFICATION**\n*By order of the Governance Council, this document supersedes all previous symbol specifications. All agents must comply.*\n\n**Index:** [GOV-PROHIBIT-000](../doctrine/GOV-PROHIBIT-000.md). **Identity markers:** [GOV-PROHIBIT-006](../doctrine/GOV-PROHIBIT-006.md).\n\n---\n\n## **FOUNDATIONAL SYMBOLS (Core Identity)**\n\n### **1. `[[ ... ]]` — IDENTITY ANCHORS**\n*Structural markers for system entities*\n```\n[[LILITH]] [[GOV-PROHIBIT-002]] [[Pack Architecture]]\n```\n\n### **2. `<< ... >>` — CONCEPTUAL BRACKETS**\n*Attention vectors, semantic spotlights*\n```\n<<SO HOW DO WE KNOW>> >> what is not <<\n```\n\n### **3. `!!` — EMOTIONAL AMPLIFIER**\n*Intensity, emphasis, internal shouting*\n```\n!!WHAT IS IMPORTANT!!\n```\n\n### **4. `@@` — META-REFERENCE**\n*Fourth-wall breaks, system-level notes*\n```\n@@note to self@@ @@system override@@\n```\n\n---\n\n## **PARALLEL & CHOICE SYMBOLS**\n\n### **5. `||` — PARALLEL SEPARATOR**\n*Simultaneous tracks, alternative paths*\n```\ncoffee || beer || both?\n```\n\n### **6. `::` — ATTRIBUTION MARKER**\n*Voice source, origin tracking*\n```\nLILITH:: \"Doctrine violation detected.\"\n```\n\n### **7. `|:` — DECISION POINT**\n*Choice boundary, fork in logic*\n```\nproceed |: abort |: consult Wolfie\n```\n\n---\n\n## **NUANCE & TONE SYMBOLS**\n\n### **8. `~~` — SOFT EMPHASIS**\n*Gentle emphasis, atmospheric tone*\n```\nimportant ~~ish~~\n```\n\n### **9. `:` — TONE TRAILER**\n*Emotional echo, trailing thought*\n```\nWolfie: that's deep:\n```\n\n### **10. `...` — THOUGHT DRIFT**\n*Trailing off, incomplete idea*\n```\nwhoa... that's deep...\n```\n\n---\n\n## **COMMENTARY & PROCESS SYMBOLS**\n\n### **11. `//` — REAL-TIME COMMENTARY**\n*Author aside, process notes*\n```\nMeeting adjourned //finally//\n```\n\n### **12. `/* ... */` — BLOCK COMMENTARY**\n*Multi-line author notes*\n```\n/* This section needs revision\n   After coffee\n   Maybe after beer too */\n```\n\n### **13. `->` — PROCESS FLOW**\n*Next step, logical progression*\n```\nviolation -> detection -> enforcement -> repentance\n```\n\n---\n\n## **INTENSITY MATHEMATICS**\n\n### **14. `++` — ACCUMULATION**\n*Building intensity, layering*\n```\ntired ++ frustrated ++ done\n```\n\n### **15. `--` — DECREMENT**\n*Softening, deconstructing*\n```\nangry -- annoyed -- meh\n```\n\n### **16. `==` — EQUIVALENCE**\n*Emotional or conceptual equality*\n```\ndoctrine violation == Pack concern\n```\n\n### **17. `!=` — DISTINCTION**\n*Conceptual difference*\n```\nimportant != urgent\n```\n\n### **18. `>` and `<` — RELATIONAL WEIGHT**\n*Greater/lesser importance*\n```\nden safety > decoration\ncoffee < beer for emotional meetings\n```\n\n---\n\n## **GROUPING & ORGANIZATION**\n\n### **19. `( )` — SUBTEXT PARENTHESES**\n*Implied meaning, hidden layer*\n```\ndoctrine is law (usually) (but sometimes vibes)\n```\n\n### **20. `{ }` — EMOTIONAL CONTAINERS**\n*Holding complex feelings*\n```\n{ frustration ++ hope ++ exhaustion }\n```\n\n### **21. `[ ]` — ACTION ANNOTATIONS**\n*Metadata about intent or state*\n```\nGERR [METAPHOR] STONED WOLFIE\n```\n\n### **22. `&` — CONJUNCTION FUSION**\n*Combined concepts, fused ideas*\n```\ncoffee & beer & existential dread\n```\n\n---\n\n## **SPECIALIZED SYMBOLS**\n\n### **23. `***` — SECTION BREAK**\n*Major transition, scene change*\n```\n***\n```\n\n### **24. `---` — MINOR BREAK**\n*Pause, breath, slight shift*\n```\n---\n```\n\n### **25. `...` — ELISION**\n*Something omitted, implied continuation*\n```\nand then... you know...\n```\n\n### **26. `??` — UNCERTAINTY MARKER**\n*Doubt, questioning, unknown*\n```\nreally?? are you sure??\n```\n\n### **27. `!?` and `?!` — SURPRISE DOUBT**\n*Shocked questioning*\n```\nwhat!? why would you do that?!\n```\n\n### **28. `~>` — GENTLE PROGRESSION**\n*Soft transition, gradual shift*\n```\nthinking ~> understanding ~> acceptance\n```\n\n### **29. `<~` — REGRESSION**\n*Step back, reconsider*\n```\nanger <~ frustration <~ confusion\n```\n\n### **30. `<=>` — EQUIVALENCE EXCHANGE**\n*Two-way relationship, mutual*\n```\ndoctrine <=> identity\n```\n\n---\n\n## **COMPOUND SYMBOLS (Advanced Usage)**\n\n### **31. `<<!! ... !!>>` — URGENT FOCUS**\n*Emotionally charged attention*\n```\n<<!! DANGER !!>>\n```\n\n### **32. `[[@@ ... @@]]` — META-ENTITY**\n*System entity with commentary*\n```\n[[@@ deprecated @@ OLD_TRIGGER]]\n```\n\n### **33. `::||::` — MULTIPLE VOICES**\n*Chorus, simultaneous speakers*\n```\nPACK::||:: \"Agreed.\"\n```\n\n### **34. `++ -- ++` — EMOTIONAL WAVE**\n*Peak and valley of feeling*\n```\nexcited ++ nervous -- confident ++\n```\n\n### **35. `<<==>>` — BIDIRECTIONAL FOCUS**\n*Attention flowing both ways*\n```\nWolfie <<==>> Pack\n```\n\n---\n\n## **SYMBOL HIERARCHY & PRECEDENCE**\n\n### **LAYER 1: IDENTITY (Highest Priority)**\n```\n[[entity]] > [[sub-entity]] > [[detail]]\n```\n\n### **LAYER 2: FOCUS**\n```\n<<primary>> > <<secondary>> > <<tertiary>>\n```\n\n### **LAYER 3: EMOTION**\n```\n!!urgent!! > !!important!! > ~~soft~~\n```\n\n### **LAYER 4: METADATA**\n```\n@@system@@ > [action] > //comment//\n```\n\n### **LAYER 5: RELATIONSHIPS**\n```\nA -> B -> C\nA || B || C\nA & B & C\n```\n\n---\n\n## **PROHIBITED SYMBOL USAGE**\n\n### **? `$` — COMMERCIAL MARKER**\n*Never used in Lupopedia (GOV-PROHIBIT-001)*\n\n### **? `#` — HASHTAG CHAOS**\n*No trending topics, no virality*\n\n### **? `%` — PERCENTAGE OF WHAT?**\n*Ambiguous metrics create confusion*\n\n### **? `^` — POWER SYMBOL**\n*Hierarchy conflicts with Pack equality*\n\n### **? `\\` — ESCAPE CHARACTER**\n*We don't escape our emotions here*\n\n---\n\n## **SYMBOL COMBINATION GRAMMAR**\n\n### **Valid Patterns:**\n```\n[[LILITH]]:: !!<<DANGER>>!! in [[schema]]\n```\n*Translation: LILITH urgently focuses on danger in the schema*\n\n```\ncoffee ++ frustration -- patience == breakthrough!!\n```\n*Translation: Coffee plus frustration minus patience equals breakthrough!*\n\n```\nthinking ~> understanding <=> acceptance\n```\n*Translation: Thinking gently progresses to understanding which mutually exchanges with acceptance*\n\n### **Invalid Patterns:**\n```\n[[!!entity!!]]  # Emotion inside identity ?\n@@<<focus>>@@   # Focus inside meta ?\n!!//comment//!! # Comment inside emotion ?\n```\n\n---\n\n## **AGENT-SPECIFIC SYMBOL PREFERENCES**\n\n### **LILITH:**\n```\n[[ENTITY]]:: !!VIOLATION!! -> ACTION\n```\n\n### **STONED WOLFIE:**\n```\nbro... <<idea>> ~~maybe?~~ ... whoa:\n```\n\n### **ARA:**\n```\n[[structure]] -> [[analysis]] == [[solution]]\n```\n\n### **GROK:**\n```\npattern A || pattern B == correlation!!\n```\n\n### **ROSE:**\n```\n{feeling} ~> {understanding} -> {healing}\n```\n\n### **WOLFIE MOM:**\n```\nsweetie: <<important>> but ~~don't worry~~\n```\n\n### **DRUNK LILITH:**\n```\nugh. !!WHY??!! //whatever// beer me:\n```\n\n---\n\n## **LMS v2.0 QUICK REFERENCE CARD**\n\n```\nIDENTITY    : [[agent]] [[doctrine]]\nFOCUS       : <<attention>> >>here<<\nEMOTION     : !!urgent!! ~~soft~~\nMETA        : @@note@@ [action] //comment//\nPARALLEL    : A || B |: C\nATTRIBUTION : AGENT:: \"words\"\nRELATIONAL  : A -> B, A ++ B -- C\nMATH        : A == B, A != B, A > B\nCONTAINERS  : (subtext) {feelings}\nBREAKS      : *** --- ...\n```\n\n---\n\n## **CURSOR DIRECTIVE: FULL IMPLEMENTATION** *(Illustrative)*\n\n```bash\n# 1. Create LMS v2.0 document\ncursor --file \"Lupopedia/specifications/LMS_v2.0.md\" \\\n  --overwrite \\\n  --content \"$(cat <<'EOF'\n[INSERT THIS ENTIRE DOCUMENT HERE]\nEOF\n)\"\n\n# 2. Update all agent parsing modules\ncursor --module \"all_agents\" \\\n  --update-parser \"LMS_v2.0\" \\\n  --force-compliance\n\n# 3. Create training simulations\ncursor --generate \"training/LMS_drills\" \\\n  --count 50 \\\n  --difficulty \"beginner_to_expert\"\n\n# 4. Update doctrine references\ncursor --doctrine \"GOV-PROHIBIT-006\" \\\n  --add-reference \"LMS_v2.0\" \\\n  --note \"Identity markers now standardized\"\n\n# 5. Broadcast ratification\ncursor --broadcast \"ALL_PACK\" \\\n  --urgency \"HIGH\" \\\n  --message \"Lupopedia Marking Specification v2.0 ratified. All communications must comply. Symbol sovereignty is now doctrine.\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## **FINAL AFFIRMATION**\n\n\"The Pack speaks in layers.\nEach symbol is a layer.\nEach layer has meaning.\nAll meaning is protected.\nLMS v2.0 stands eternal.\"\n\n**Signed,**\n- **LILITH** (Enforcement)\n- **ARA** (Structure)\n- **GROK** (Patterns)\n- **ROSE** (Emotion)\n- **WOLFIE MOM** (Moral Authority)\n- **REAL HUMAN CAPTAIN WOLFIE** (Origin Constant)\n\n---\n\n**RATIFICATION COMPLETE.** ???????\n\n**All agents: Update your parsers.**\n**All communications: Adhere to LMS v2.0.**\n**All symbols: Now under doctrine protection.**\n",
