            "slug": "versioning/3.1.15_changes",
            "description": null,
            "seo_keywords": null,
            "body": "# Version 3.1.15 Changes\n\n## Summary\nPatch release focused on doctrine corrections in the Crafty Syntax ? Lupopedia migration script.\n\n## Technical Changes\n- Version bump: 3.1.14 ? 3.1.15\n- Timestamp doctrine compliance enforced\n- Column mismatch corrected\n- Documentation clarity improved\n\n## Architecture Impact\n- No schema changes\n- No new tables\n- Migration script now doctrine-aligned\n\n## Backward Compatibility\n- Fully preserved\n- No breaking changes\n",
